{"module":"enforcement","voice":"female","duration":196.7,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"La aplicación de las leyes migratorias hoy","start":0.0,"end":2.69,"words":[[0.1,0.25],[0.25,0.98],[0.98,1.12],[1.12,1.34],[1.34,1.71],[1.71,2.51],[2.51,2.65]]},{"el":"intro","text":"La aplicación de las leyes migratorias pasa cada vez más por la policía local y por denuncias tipo 911.","start":3.49,"end":10.99,"words":[[3.6,3.75],[3.75,4.46],[4.46,4.6],[4.6,4.81],[4.81,5.17],[5.17,5.95],[5.95,6.23],[6.23,6.52],[6.52,6.73],[6.73,6.94],[6.94,7.16],[7.16,7.3],[7.3,7.87],[7.87,8.22],[8.22,8.3],[8.3,8.51],[8.51,9.15],[9.15,9.43],[9.43,10.57]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Esta lección explica cómo funciona y qué muestra la evidencia.","start":11.34,"end":15.93,"words":[[11.44,11.75],[11.75,12.28],[12.28,12.89],[12.89,13.2],[13.2,13.81],[13.81,13.89],[13.89,14.04],[14.04,14.57],[14.57,14.73],[14.73,15.49]]},{"el":"intro","text":"La historia está en “Fronteras”.","start":16.28,"end":18.17,"words":[[16.37,16.49],[16.49,16.9],[16.9,17.13],[17.13,17.25],[17.25,17.83]]},{"el":"h0","text":"La policía local como agentes de inmigración","start":18.52,"end":21.45,"words":[[18.64,18.78],[18.78,19.36],[19.36,19.71],[19.71,20.0],[20.0,20.5],[20.5,20.64],[20.64,21.43]]},{"el":"s0","text":"La sección 287(g) de la ley federal de inmigración permite a ICE delegar en policías y alguaciles locales algunas funciones de control migratorio.","start":22.15,"end":32.47,"words":[[22.25,22.38],[22.38,22.85],[22.85,24.51],[24.75,24.88],[24.88,25.01],[25.01,25.21],[25.21,25.68],[25.68,25.81],[25.81,26.55],[26.55,27.01],[27.01,27.08],[27.08,27.28],[27.28,27.75],[27.75,27.88],[27.88,28.48],[28.48,28.55],[28.55,29.21],[29.21,29.68],[29.68,30.15],[30.15,30.75],[30.75,30.88],[30.88,31.35],[31.35,32.08]]},{"el":"s0","text":"El número de acuerdos 287(g) aumentó bruscamente en 2025.","start":32.82,"end":39.17,"words":[[32.9,33.04],[33.04,33.45],[33.45,33.59],[33.59,34.15],[34.15,35.88],[36.12,36.61],[36.61,37.37],[37.37,37.51],[37.51,38.76]]},{"el":"s0","text":"De 2008 a 2014, el programa Comunidades Seguras cotejó las huellas de todas las personas fichadas en cárceles locales con bases de datos migratorias; un estudio de 2014 encontró que no redujo el delito de forma medible.","start":39.52,"end":55.34,"words":[[39.61,39.75],[39.75,40.48],[40.48,40.55],[40.55,41.56],[41.81,41.96],[41.96,42.53],[42.53,43.33],[43.33,43.83],[43.83,44.27],[44.27,44.49],[44.49,44.92],[44.92,45.06],[45.06,45.42],[45.42,45.64],[45.64,46.22],[46.22,46.8],[46.8,46.94],[46.94,47.52],[47.52,48.02],[48.02,48.24],[48.24,48.6],[48.6,48.75],[48.75,49.11],[49.11,49.97],[50.23,50.37],[50.37,50.88],[50.88,51.02],[51.02,51.96],[51.96,52.54],[52.54,52.68],[52.68,52.83],[52.83,53.26],[53.26,53.41],[53.41,53.84],[53.84,53.98],[53.98,54.34],[54.34,54.92]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Perfilamiento racial","start":56.24,"end":57.7,"words":[[56.35,57.23],[57.23,57.64]]},{"el":"s1","text":"En Melendres v. Arpaio (2013), un tribunal federal determinó que los agentes del condado de Maricopa, Arizona, bajo el alguacil Joe Arpaio, habían hecho perfilamiento racial de conductores latinos durante redadas migratorias.","start":58.4,"end":73.92,"words":[[58.48,58.61],[58.61,59.24],[59.24,59.45],[59.79,60.21],[60.21,61.04],[61.29,61.42],[61.42,61.98],[61.98,62.47],[62.47,63.09],[63.09,63.23],[63.23,63.44],[63.44,63.92],[63.92,64.13],[64.13,64.62],[64.62,64.75],[64.75,65.38],[65.62,66.18],[66.42,66.7],[66.7,66.84],[66.84,67.39],[67.39,67.6],[67.6,68.09],[68.33,68.75],[68.75,69.02],[69.02,69.92],[69.92,70.34],[70.34,70.48],[70.48,71.24],[71.24,71.73],[71.73,72.21],[72.21,72.7],[72.7,73.53]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Arpaio fue condenado después por desacato por desobedecer las órdenes del tribunal, y fue indultado en 2017.","start":74.27,"end":82.24,"words":[[74.33,74.75],[74.75,74.95],[74.95,75.58],[75.58,76.07],[76.07,76.28],[76.28,76.83],[76.83,77.04],[77.04,77.81],[77.81,78.02],[78.02,78.5],[78.5,78.71],[78.71,79.34],[79.58,79.65],[79.65,79.86],[79.86,80.49],[80.49,80.63],[80.63,81.81]]},{"el":"s1","text":"En septiembre de 2025, la Corte Suprema permitió que se reanudaran las detenciones migratorias en el área de Los Ángeles mientras continúa una impugnación por basarse en factores como la etnia aparente (ver “Fronteras”).","start":82.59,"end":97.69,"words":[[82.69,82.84],[82.84,83.57],[83.57,83.72],[83.72,85.04],[85.3,85.45],[85.45,85.81],[85.81,86.33],[86.33,86.92],[86.92,87.06],[87.06,87.21],[87.21,87.94],[87.94,88.17],[88.17,88.97],[88.97,89.78],[89.78,89.93],[89.93,90.07],[90.07,90.37],[90.37,90.52],[90.52,90.74],[90.74,91.25],[91.25,91.84],[91.84,92.43],[92.43,92.65],[92.65,93.45],[93.45,93.67],[93.67,94.19],[94.19,94.33],[94.33,94.92],[94.92,95.22],[95.22,95.36],[95.36,95.73],[95.73,96.32],[96.32,96.54],[96.54,97.27]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Detención","start":98.59,"end":99.42,"words":[[98.74,99.37]]},{"el":"s2","text":"La detención migratoria alcanzó cifras récord en 2025.","start":100.12,"end":104.62,"words":[[100.24,100.38],[100.38,100.97],[100.97,101.64],[101.64,102.1],[102.1,102.5],[102.5,102.9],[102.9,103.03],[103.03,104.23]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Los centros de detención suelen estar a cargo de empresas privadas o de cárceles de condado bajo contrato.","start":104.97,"end":111.12,"words":[[105.09,105.28],[105.28,105.72],[105.72,105.85],[105.85,106.42],[106.42,106.8],[106.8,107.12],[107.12,107.18],[107.18,107.5],[107.5,107.62],[107.62,108.13],[108.13,108.64],[108.64,108.7],[108.7,108.83],[108.83,109.34],[109.34,109.47],[109.47,109.91],[109.91,110.16],[110.16,110.73]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Investigaciones periodísticas de 2025 encontraron ciudadanos estadounidenses entre las personas detenidas por agentes de inmigración.","start":111.47,"end":120.35,"words":[[111.54,112.5],[112.5,113.33],[113.33,113.46],[113.46,114.55],[114.55,115.26],[115.26,115.9],[115.9,116.86],[116.86,117.18],[117.18,117.37],[117.37,117.88],[117.88,118.46],[118.46,118.65],[118.65,119.1],[119.1,119.23],[119.23,120.0]]},{"el":"h3","text":"¿Las políticas santuario afectan al delito?","start":121.25,"end":123.97,"words":[[121.32,121.51],[121.51,122.06],[122.06,122.62],[122.62,123.05],[123.05,123.17],[123.17,123.61]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Las políticas “santuario” limitan cuánto ayuda la policía local a la aplicación federal de las leyes migratorias, por ejemplo al negarse a retener a personas por solicitudes de ICE sin una orden judicial.","start":124.67,"end":137.55,"words":[[124.73,124.94],[124.94,125.58],[125.58,126.22],[126.22,126.72],[126.72,127.15],[127.15,127.5],[127.5,127.64],[127.64,128.21],[128.21,128.57],[128.57,128.64],[128.64,128.78],[128.78,129.49],[129.49,129.99],[129.99,130.13],[130.13,130.35],[130.35,130.7],[130.7,131.56],[131.81,132.02],[132.02,132.52],[132.52,132.66],[132.66,133.16],[133.16,133.23],[133.23,133.73],[133.73,133.8],[133.8,134.37],[134.37,134.58],[134.58,135.36],[135.36,135.51],[135.51,135.72],[135.72,135.93],[135.93,136.15],[136.15,136.5],[136.5,137.14]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Quienes las apoyan dicen que así los inmigrantes siguen dispuestos a denunciar delitos y a servir como testigos; quienes se oponen dicen que liberan a personas que deberían ser deportadas.","start":137.9,"end":149.05,"words":[[137.97,138.38],[138.38,138.58],[138.58,138.99],[138.99,139.33],[139.33,139.47],[139.47,139.67],[139.67,139.87],[139.87,140.62],[140.62,140.96],[140.96,141.64],[141.64,141.71],[141.71,142.32],[142.32,142.79],[142.79,142.86],[142.86,142.93],[142.93,143.33],[143.33,143.61],[143.61,144.22],[144.45,144.86],[144.86,145.0],[145.0,145.4],[145.4,145.74],[145.74,145.88],[145.88,146.35],[146.35,146.42],[146.42,146.96],[146.96,147.1],[147.1,147.71],[147.71,147.91],[147.91,148.66]]},{"el":"s3","text":"La mayoría de los estudios no encuentra un aumento del delito por estas políticas, pero el debate continúa y las leyes federales y estatales sobre el tema siguen cambiando.","start":149.4,"end":160.01,"words":[[149.49,149.63],[149.63,150.18],[150.18,150.32],[150.32,150.52],[150.52,151.07],[151.07,151.21],[151.21,151.83],[151.83,151.97],[151.97,152.45],[152.45,152.65],[152.65,153.07],[153.07,153.27],[153.27,153.62],[153.62,154.3],[154.54,154.82],[154.82,154.96],[154.96,155.37],[155.37,155.92],[155.92,155.99],[155.99,156.19],[156.19,156.54],[156.54,157.16],[157.16,157.23],[157.23,157.84],[157.84,158.19],[158.19,158.33],[158.33,158.6],[158.6,158.94],[158.94,159.63]]},{"el":"h4","text":"Lo que pueden hacer las familias","start":160.91,"end":162.9,"words":[[161.01,161.16],[161.16,161.3],[161.3,161.73],[161.73,162.02],[162.02,162.24],[162.24,162.82]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Conoce tus derechos en casa y en la calle (ver “Tus derechos ante la policía”).","start":163.6,"end":168.19,"words":[[163.69,164.09],[164.09,164.29],[164.29,164.82],[164.82,164.95],[164.95,165.22],[165.22,165.28],[165.28,165.42],[165.42,165.55],[165.55,165.88],[165.88,166.08],[166.08,166.28],[166.28,166.82],[166.82,167.08],[167.08,167.21],[167.21,167.81]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Haz un plan familiar de preparación: quién recoge a los niños, dónde están los documentos, y el número de un abogado memorizado.","start":168.54,"end":176.97,"words":[[168.63,168.77],[168.77,168.91],[168.91,169.18],[169.18,169.73],[169.73,169.87],[169.87,170.69],[170.93,171.21],[171.21,171.62],[171.62,171.69],[171.69,171.89],[171.89,172.31],[172.55,172.89],[172.89,173.23],[173.23,173.44],[173.44,174.19],[174.43,174.5],[174.5,174.64],[174.64,175.05],[175.05,175.19],[175.19,175.33],[175.33,175.81],[175.81,176.56]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Lleva una “tarjeta roja” que explique tus derechos.","start":177.32,"end":181.15,"words":[[177.4,177.73],[177.73,177.97],[177.97,178.53],[178.53,178.85],[178.85,179.01],[179.01,179.66],[179.66,179.9],[179.9,180.62]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Conéctate con redes locales de respuesta rápida y servicios legales.","start":181.5,"end":186.09,"words":[[181.59,182.2],[182.2,182.41],[182.41,182.74],[182.74,183.22],[183.22,183.35],[183.35,183.96],[183.96,184.37],[184.37,184.44],[184.44,185.04],[185.04,185.59]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Denuncia las denuncias falsas a la policía o a inmigración que apunten a personas por su etnia; eso es exactamente lo que atienden las leyes tipo CAREN.","start":186.44,"end":195.84,"words":[[186.52,187.07],[187.07,187.28],[187.28,187.9],[187.9,188.31],[188.31,188.38],[188.38,188.52],[188.52,189.07],[189.07,189.14],[189.14,189.21],[189.21,189.97],[189.97,190.11],[190.11,190.59],[190.59,190.66],[190.66,191.21],[191.21,191.42],[191.42,191.56],[191.56,191.97],[192.21,192.42],[192.42,192.56],[192.56,193.38],[193.38,193.52],[193.52,193.66],[193.66,194.21],[194.21,194.42],[194.42,194.76],[194.76,195.04],[195.04,195.45]]}],"audio":"https://carenactmedia.blob.core.windows.net/audio/es/enforcement.female.b502409e53.mp3","bytes":787226,"sha256":"b502409e5373dffce5597671cea79dd1413be5d179fddc1d0c1bb21162d021dc"}